"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025, February to March came in at 5% of normal on the middle, and August to September at 49%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 14516 got 31% of normal that year.</p>"}
